TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas, compare Ba at steps 10 and 70
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4
    Fe(2) 4
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file albite_h2s.sel
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -totals Ba Fe(2) Fe(3) S(-2) S(6) Na Al Si
END
